WEBVTT

00:11:59.892 --> 00:12:02.786
The 442nd was called in

00:12:02.786 --> 00:12:06.108
to add to the fight,

00:12:06.108 --> 00:12:08.274
but the men of the 442nd

00:12:08.274 --> 00:12:11.434
came up with a unique

00:12:11.434 --> 00:12:13.734
but dangerous idea:

00:12:13.734 --> 00:12:15.529
The backside of the mountain

00:12:15.529 --> 00:12:18.190
was a sheer rock cliff.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:21.599
The Germans thought an attack from the backside

00:12:21.599 --> 00:12:24.109
would be impossible.

00:12:24.109 --> 00:12:28.480
The men of the 442nd decided to do the impossible.

00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:32.223
On a dark, moonless night,